  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8009.01 Fees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8009.01 Fees. The following fees shall apply:\n\n(a) Application for an original specialty license is $225.00.\n\n(b) Renewal application fee for a specialty license is $200.00.\n\n(c) Late fee for renewal of specialty license is $75.00.\n\n(d) Reinstatement fee for specialty license is $125.00.\n\n(e) Replacement of lost or damaged license is $50.00.\n\n(f) Application for original license by non-New Hampshire license holder is $250.00.\n\n(g) Application for a business entity license is $325.00.\n\n(h) Renewal application fee for a business entity license is $300.00.\n\n(i) Late fee for renewal of a business entity license is $100.00.\n\n(j) Reinstatement fee for a business entity license is $150.00.\n\nSource. #8954, eff 7-21-07; amd by #9542, eff 9-10-09",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c8000.html"
}
